\b0 \cf0 The design studios register the day and the type of visit they want to offer, including the maximum amount of people. If you have registered on the site (and has an access code), you can apply for a visit every 30 days (this rule is that all subscribers can participate in any visit). Then just show up on the day and time scheduled and enjoy :)\
When the maximum number of participants is reached, a waiting list begins: if any waiver, call anyone on that list (in order of registration). Those called have 24 hours to confirm the interest, otherwise the chance go to the next on the list.
